tei:div.tei:p:
rmongs kha'i bal dang*/ gseb nag po dkar thig med pa'i rnga rngog gi spu so sor sgril la/ bsrung mdud gsum sgril bya/ gseb nag bang gis me bus la/ lcag sder so ma'i nang du gseb nag gi chu yi nang du btsos/ bsrung skud mi gsal ba dang*/ nya ra byas/ dgos dus mtho sar btags pas/ sir si sod ka kong*// ༈ //srin dug gi sngags la/ oṃ ra lang song*/ dug lang song*/ du spra ma sod/ spra ti nag po sod/ nag po mthing sod/ dug sod/ dug zhi zhi raṃ raṃ/ zhes brgya rtsa bzlas te chu la btab skol la nad pa la blud/ nad tshabs che na gsum 'debs par byed do//
// ༈ //mig kha bas mi 'phyid pa'i thabs dang*/ 'phyid pa gnyis ka la 'di ltar bya ste/ de'i sngags ni/ oṃ tsha lo tsha lo nga*/ grang thar thar zhes brgya rtsa bzlas la/ kha ba changs pa gcig la btab nas rgyab tu skyur/ phyid tshar na/ sha dmar la btab nas mi lag mi 'grim/ mig la brlan/ des phan nges so//
// ༈ //rims bsrung la/ oṃ lce dmar rtse mor sod/ nan sod/ thib thib sod/ hā ra la thim sod/ sang sod dal sod/ rag gan bcod sod/ zhi zhi/ mal du zhi/ du du rang du du/ song song khong du song*/ ling ling sod/ bram ze nag po sod/ lhog pa sod/ gnyen sod/ rgyu gzer sod/ dmar bshal sod/ 'byung po'i nad sod swā hā/ zhes pas/ rang bsrung na/ rang la tho rangs mi dang kha ma lab pa'i gong du bzlas nas/ sna bug tu phus btab cing*/ gzhan bsrung na snod nag po'i nang du chu gtsang blugs la/ kha dar nag gis bcad/ gnam ma mthong bar bya/ bsrung skud byed na/ skud pa nag po sum sgril la mdud pa zhal shes ltar byas sngags khri bzlas nas gdags so//
'dis dmar bshal thub nges so// ༈ //yang chos kyi rje mnyam med de nyid kyi drung du a phyi'i chos bskor thob pa la/ rgyal ba 'jig rten mgon po mtshan mchog rin chen dpal bzang pos mdzad pa'i sgrub gzhung*/ rgyan can lnga ma/ le'u bco lnga ma las tshogs cha lag dang bcas pa/
